{{/*
GameDeal Radar Slack messages. Slack mrkdwn is supported (*bold*, `code`, <url|label>).
Every message starts with the project tag "[GameDeal Radar]" because one Slack channel is
shared by all projects in the repository. Keep the tag first in any custom template too.

Fields available in every template:
  {{.SlotLabel}}    slot start in IST and UTC, e.g. "00:00 IST / 18:30 UTC, 11 Oct"
  {{.Attempt}}      attempt number, 1 to 6
  {{.Total}}        active games with a Steam mapping
  {{.Updated}}      price snapshots written in this run
  {{.Skipped}}      games with no Steam price (recorded as checked)
  {{.Failed}}       games that failed for good in this run
  {{.Retried}}      games that went through a retry pass
  {{.CoveragePct}}  share of games checked in this slot, e.g. "99.6"
  {{.Duration}}     how long this run took, e.g. "7m12s"
  {{.RunURL}}       link to the GitHub Actions run (empty outside Actions)

To customize without code changes, set GDR_NOTIFY_TEMPLATE_DIR to a folder with files
named success.tmpl, attempt_failed.tmpl and final_failed.tmpl. Each file holds only the
message text. A missing or broken file falls back to the text below.
*/}}
{{- define "success" -}}
[GameDeal Radar] :white_check_mark: GameDeal Radar {{.SlotLabel}} complete. {{.Total}} games, {{.Updated}} updated, {{.Skipped}} skipped, {{.Retried}} retried, {{.CoveragePct}}% coverage ({{.Duration}}). {{.RunURL}}
{{- end}}

{{- define "attempt_failed" -}}
[GameDeal Radar] :warning: GameDeal Radar {{.SlotLabel}} attempt {{.Attempt}} of 6 ended at {{.CoveragePct}}% coverage ({{.Failed}} of {{.Total}} games failed). The next attempt will retry. {{.RunURL}}
{{- end}}

{{- define "final_failed"}}
[GameDeal Radar] :rotating_light: GameDeal Radar {{.SlotLabel}} FAILED after {{.Attempt}} attempts. Coverage {{.CoveragePct}}%, {{.Failed}} of {{.Total}} games failed. A GitHub issue was opened. {{.RunURL}}
{{- end}}

{{- define "job_success"}}
[GameDeal Radar] :white_check_mark: {{.Job}} finished. {{.Detail}} ({{.Duration}}). {{.RunURL}}
{{- end}}

{{- define "job_failed"}}
[GameDeal Radar] :rotating_light: {{.Job}} FAILED. {{.Detail}} ({{.Duration}}). {{.RunURL}}
{{- end}}
